OL,3,AMan jailed for killing ex days after
OL,4,Aearly release
OL,5,
OL,6,FA violent offender who was released
OL,7,Ffrom jail the day after he was
OL,8,Fsentenced stabbed his former partner
OL,9,Fand then begged to be returned to
OL,10,Fprison because he was going to "go on a
OL,11,Fmurder spree", the Old Bailey has
OL,12,Fheard.
OL,14,FRobert Sabat, 60, pleaded guilty to
OL,15,Fmurdering 42-year-old mother-of-two
OL,16,FDickiesha Nurse, who he stabbed at her
OL,17,Fflat in Tulse Hill, south London, last
OL,18,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
