OL,3,AIsraelis mourn 7 October attack victims
OL,4,Athree years after deadly Hamas raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FMemorial events have taken place in
OL,7,FIsrael on the third anniversary of the
OL,8,Fdevastating Hamas-led attack there that
OL,9,Fsparked the war in Gaza.
OL,11,FFamilies paid tribute to their loved
OL,12,Fones at some of the sites where about
OL,13,F1,200 people were killed in the assault
OL,14,Fand 251 were taken hostage.
OL,16,F"The nation unites on this day in the
OL,17,Flonging for our dear ones," said
OL,18,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,19,FNetanyahu, who faced calls from
OL,20,Fprotesters for an independent state
OL,21,Finquiry into security failures that
OL,22,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
